%description:
Tests the order of the AccECN option fields with accEcnOptionPolicy="rfc"
(RFC 9768 section 3.2.3.3, Table 5). The tester marks A003 and A004 ECT(1),
so the server sends an AccECN1 option with EE1B alone. After the ECT(0)
segment A005 both counts changed, and the option has the three fields.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 3000"
*.*_tcp.tcpEcnMode = "accecn"
*.tcptester.script="a3 ect1; a4 ect1"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1:1013(1012) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(1)   Option(s): NOP AccECN0(e0b=1,ceb=0,e1b=1)# marking ECT(1)
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 1013 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP NOP AccECN1(e1b=1013)
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 1013:2037(1024) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(1) # marking ECT(1)
[1.407 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 2037 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP NOP AccECN1(e1b=2037)
[1.409 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A E N 2037:3001(964) ack 501 win 16384 ECT(0) 
[1.611 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A E N ack 3001 win 16384   Option(s): NOP AccECN0(e0b=965,ceb=0,e1b=2037)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
